            src/scripts/Tricx/CanonBandingReduction/
         </remove>
         <description>
            <p>
               Installs the SensorDestripe PixInsight feature script, which reduces the horizontal banding along the sensor rows of DSLR and mirrorless camera images with live preview and highlight protection.
            </p>
            <p>
               Changes in 0.11.0: the script formerly named CanonBandingReduction is now SensorDestripe. It is found under Script &gt; Tricx &gt; SensorDestripe, and the CanonBandingReduction files installed from this repository are removed. Saved settings are taken over.
            </p>
            <p>
               Based on CanonBandingReduction by Georg Viehoever (GPLv3).
            </p>
            <p>
               New in 0.11.1:
               <br/>- The script name is now shown in the History Explorer.
            </p>
            <p>
               Installed files:
               <br/>src/scripts/Tricx/SensorDestripe/SensorDestripe.js
               <br/>src/scripts/Tricx/SensorDestripe/SensorDestripe.svg
               <br/>src/scripts/Tricx/SensorDestripe/SensorDestripe.xsgn
            </p>
         </description>
      </package>
   </platform>
</xri>
